Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 03:08:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 295/307] !R (Terrain Plate) Make terrain stamping a repeatable
 action.

After height stamping, adopt the stamped ground as the new baseline and keep
the plate live. Record stamped colour state so preview and export avoid double
blending until the plate transform or material changes.
